config BR2_PACKAGE_S3VE3G_FIRMWARE
	bool "s3ve3g-firmware [Galaxy S III Neo]"
	select BR2_PACKAGE_KMOD
	select BR2_PACKAGE_KMOD_TOOLS
	select BR2_PACKAGE_WIRELESS_REGDB
	help
	  Firmware plumbing for the Galaxy S III Neo. Ships no firmware.

	  The WCNSS (Pronto) Wi-Fi/Bluetooth image lives on the phone's
	  own `apnhlos` partition and its NV calibration on `system`; the
	  MAC addresses live on `efs`. None of it may be redistributed, and
	  every phone has its own. s3ve3g-bringup, run by erlinit before
	  Erlang starts, links the images it finds on the read-only stock
	  partitions into /run/firmware, points the kernel firmware loader
	  there, copies the MAC addresses to /run/s3ve3g and loads the
	  drivers.
